  "findings": [
    "L5mkn (MKN n=5 alpha=0.8) is the cross-corpus champion (geomean 5.48) — generalizes from pinned ASCII to kodama-lab UTF-8 mixed.",
    "Lmkn5d2 (MKN n=5 alpha=1.5) wins ON pinned (3.49) but LOSES on kodama (9.40 vs L5mkn's 8.49) — high-alpha saturates discount to D=0.99 everywhere, over-blurs when corpus diversity is higher.",
